+---
+id: task-002-correct-order-discounts-coupons-and-delivery-vat
+type: task
+title: "Correct order discounts, coupons and delivery VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Correct the three reported pricing defects while retaining the documented discount and coupon rules.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- Percentage coupons apply to the subtotal after volume discounts, without subtracting the volume
+  discount a second time.
+- A coupon whose last valid date is 30 November can be used on 30 November.
+- Delivery charges do not have VAT, and receipts and totals reflect zero delivery VAT.
+- Regression tests cover each report and the complete test suite passes.
